  "intro": "Authentication is the fullstack integration topic freshers get quizzed on most. Interviewers want to know whether you understand the complete flow — from the login POST request to how the token is stored, sent with every subsequent request, validated on the server, and eventually expired. This module covers JWT vs sessions, safe token storage, Spring Security integration, and the security fundamentals (XSS, CSRF) that round out any serious answer."
